# package-lock.json IS committed (since 2026-10-01): CI runs `npm ci`, so every
# run installs exactly the versions in the lockfile instead of re-resolving
# ranges against the live registry (a fresh-publish 404 for
# baseline-browser-mapping broke CI once). Update it with `npm install` and
# commit the result alongside any package.json change.

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo
